{"availability":"available","full":"casdoor/casdoor","name":"casdoor","description":"An open-source Agent-first Identity and Access Management (IAM) /LLM MCP & agent gateway and auth server with web UI supporting OpenClaw, MCP, OAuth, OIDC, SAML, CAS, LDAP, SCIM, WebAuthn, TOTP, MFA, Face ID, Google Workspace, Azure AD","category":"Other","language":"Go","stars":14513,"forks":1832,"created":"2020-10-22T14:40:03Z","updated":"2026-10-05T18:45:04Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://casdoor.ai","topics":["agent","agentic-ai","agi","ai-gateway","auth","authentication","iam","llm","mcp","mcp-gateway","mfa","oauth","oidc","openclaw","radius","saml","scim","single-sign-on","sso","webauthn"],"demo":"https://demo.casdoor.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.034Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.034Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.034Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.034Z","stars":14513,"forks":1832}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The sign-in page your users see: password, email/SMS code, WebAuthn and Face ID, plus every social provider you enable.","Admin console. Users, tokens, organizations and providers at a glance. Applications. Every app that delegates login to Casdoor, across all organizations. Application settings. OAuth, SAML, providers and branding — no redeploy, no config file.","Casdoor is a complete identity provider, not an authentication proxy and not a library you embed. It stores your users, issues the tokens, and gives you an admin console to manage all of it — so your applications can delegate login entirely and never handle a password themselves."],"features":["One server, many protocols. The same user directory is reachable over OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SAML 2.0, CAS, LDAP and SCIM, so a modern SPA and a legacy CAS-only app can share one set of accounts.","Everything is editable in the UI. Organizations, applications, providers, sign-in methods, email and SMS templates, and login-page branding are configured in the web console instead of in files you have to redeploy.","Policy-based authorization built in. Access rules are expressed with Casbin — ACL, RBAC, ABAC and custom models — rather than a fixed permission scheme.","Straightforward to self-host. A single Go binary plus a database. No JVM, no operator, no cluster required.","OAuth 2.0 / OIDC — full authorization server and OpenID Connect provider"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"40a147649ffc7c38784881e42181eb9747f2852d76bd8238422604692f32ee2f","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.228Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.228Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The sign-in page your users see: password, email/SMS code, WebAuthn and Face ID, plus every social provider you enable.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The sign-in page your users see: password, email/SMS code, WebAuthn and Face ID, plus every social provider you enable.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Every app that delegates login to Casdoor, across all organizations.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Straightforward to self-host.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"40a147649ffc7c38784881e42181eb9747f2852d76bd8238422604692f32ee2f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.229Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T18:45:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:24:25.735Z","hash":"40a147649ffc7c387848